    <h2>About the Project</h2>
    <p>
      Soror is a boss-rush action game focusing on advanced enemy AI,
      parry mechanics, and telegraphed patterns. Each encounter builds
      around timing, positioning, and reading the boss.
    </p>

    <h2>Gameplay Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Advanced boss AI with multiple phases</li>
      <li>Area-of-effect telegraphs (AOE)</li>
      <li>Parry-based combat system</li>
      <li>Fast iteration tools for attack patterns</li>
    </ul>

